# Force LF line endings across platforms.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts with ``core.autocrlf=true`` rewrite caption
# fixtures to CRLF, which then propagates through line-terminator detection
# (``Caption.metadata['line_terminator']``) and breaks tests that assert on
# specific byte sequences (e.g. ``"1\n" in srt_content``).
#
# Test fixtures must be byte-identical across platforms — caption format
# parsers care about exact bytes, so LF normalization is mandatory.
tests/data/** text eol=lf

# Source code follows the same convention.
*.py text eol=lf
